{"version":"1.0","info":{"style":"RPC","product":"SuperappNlp","version":"2024-09-30"},"directories":["NlpAddressNormalization"],"components":{"schemas":{}},"apis":{"NlpAddressNormalization":{"summary":"AI Administrative Region Standardization Service\n\nIn real-world business scenarios, the given raw textual address may lack administrative region names (for example, province, city, or district), may contain incorrect administrative region names, or may include administrative region names that are not yet aligned with the downstream industry's internal address database.  \nThe AI Administrative Region Standardization Service leverages state-of-the-art AI and multilingual NLP technologies to accurately analyze and understand the input unstructured textual address content, and predict standardized, aligned administrative region names.  \nThis service has already been used to support logistics industry customers in actual production scenarios, such as AI-powered address sorting and automatic freight settlement.\n","methods":["post"],"schemes":["https"],"security":[{"AK":[]}],"operationType":"read","deprecated":false,"systemTags":{"operationType":"none","riskType":"none","chargeType":"free","tenantRelevance":"tenant"},"parameters":[{"name":"ClientToken","in":"query","allowEmptyValue":false,"schema":{"title":"","description":"Idempotency parameter","type":"string","required":false,"example":"可以不填","enumValueTitles":{"无":"无"}}},{"name":"InstanceId","in":"query","schema":{"description":"Instance ID","type":"string","required":false,"example":"10671","enumValueTitles":{"无":"无"},"title":""}},{"name":"QueryStr","in":"query","schema":{"description":"Address to parse","type":"string","required":false,"example":"350 Magliman, Bacolor, Pampanga AQUA MALTA Refilling Station","enumValueTitles":{"无":"无"},"title":""}},{"name":"CityStr","in":"query","schema":{"description":"City or district value","type":"string","required":false,"example":"BACOLOR\t","title":""}},{"name":"ProvinceStr